-s006.wav"},{"id":"u16-p122-s007","speaker":"narrator","text":"The girl/boy in the picture is in …","rects":[{"x":49.2022,"y":78.5359,"w":32.7742,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ðə ˈgɜːl ˈbɔɪ ɪn ðə ˈpɪktʃə ɪz ˈɪn …/","meaning":"照片中的女孩/男孩在..。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u16/u16-p122-s007.wav"},{"id":"u16-p122-s008","speaker":"narrator","text":"matches …","rects":[{"x":51.8587,"y":81.2771,"w":10.6447,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ˈmætʃɪz …/","meaning":"匹配..。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u16/u16-p122-s008.wav"},{"id":"u16-p122-s009","speaker":"narrator","text":"well.","rects":[{"x":63.0958,"y":81.2771,"w":4.5349,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ˈwel./","meaning":"不错","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u16/u16-p122-s009.wav"},{"id":"u16-p122-s010","speaker":"narrator","text":"She/He also wears … She/He looks good/cool/beautiful in … go well together.","rects":[{"x":49.2022,"y":84.0183,"w":19.8239,"h":1.7375},{"x":49.2022,"y":86.7595,"w":37.4309,"h":1.7375},{"x":51.8587,"y":89.5006,"w":15.9514,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ˌʃiː ˌhiː ˈɔːlsəʊ ˈweəz … ˌʃiː ˌhiː ˈlʊks ˈgʊd ˈkuːl ˈbjuːtɪfʊl ˈɪn … ˌgəʊ ˈwel təˈgeðə./","meaning":"她/他也穿...她/他看起来好/酷/漂亮..。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u16/u16-p122-s010.wav"}]},{"page":123,"pdfPage":124,"width":532.9130249023438,"height":754.0159912109375,"image":"assets/pages/page-123.webp","sentences":[{"id":"u16-p123-s024","speaker":"narrator","text":"Unit 6","rects":[{"x":84.4168,"y":3.6233,"w":6.0077,"h":1.8477}],"ipa":"/ˈjuːnɪt ˈsɪks/","meaning":"第6单元","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u16/u16-p123-s024.wav"},{"id":"u16-p123-s025","speaker":"narrator","text":"C DIY fashion","rects":[{"x":12.0053,"y":6.4851,"w":20.2949,"h":2.6041}],"ipa":"/ˈsiː ˌdiːˌaɪˈwaɪ ˈfæʃən/","meaning":"C DIY 时尚","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u16/u16-p123-s025.wav"},{"id":"u16-p123-s002","speaker":"narrator","text":"Read the ad with her and answer the questions below.","rects":[{"x":53.3914,"y":10.2356,"w":32.3008,"h":2.0721},{"x":12.0052,"y":12.225,"w":14.6073,"h":2.0721}],"ipa":"/ˈriːd ðiː ˈæd wɪð hɜː ænd ˈɑːnsə ðə ˈkwestʃənz bɪˈləʊ./","meaning":"和她一起看广告，回答下面的问题。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u16/u16-p123-s002.wav"},{"id":"u16-p123-s001","speaker":"narrator","text":"C1 Sandy found an ad for a design workshop.","rects":[{"x":12.7669,"y":10.2356,"w":40.1697,"h":2.0721}],"ipa":"/ˈsiː ˈwʌn ˈsændiː ˈfaʊnd ən ˈæd fɔː ə dɪˈzaɪn ˈwɜːkʃɒp./","meaning":"C1 Sandy为设计车间找到广告。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u16/u16-p123-s001.wav"},{"id":"u16-p123-s003","speaker":"narrator","text":"Do you like fashion?","rects":[{"x":21.0111,"y":17.0934,"w":19.8321,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ˈduː juː ˈlaɪk ˈfæʃən?/","meaning":"你喜欢时尚吗？","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u16/u16-p123-s003.wav"},{"id":"u16-p123-s004","speaker":"narrator","text":"Do you want to make a T-shirt with your own design?","rects":[{"x":41.4357,"y":17.0934,"w":44.0644,"h":1.7375},{"x":21.0111,"y":19.2161,"w":7.1708,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ˈduː juː ˈwɒnt tə ˌmeɪk ə ˈtiːʃɜːt wɪð jɔː ˈəʊn dɪˈzaɪn?/","meaning":"你想用自己的设计做件T恤吗？","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u16/u16-p123-s004.wav"},{"id":"u16-p123-s005","speaker":"narrator","text":"Why not come to our T-shirt design workshop?","rects":[{"x":21.0111,"y":22.09,"w":45.4725,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ˌwaɪ ˌnɒt ˈkʌm tʊ ˌaʊə ˈtiːʃɜːt dɪˈzaɪn ˈwɜːkʃɒp?/","meaning":"为什么不来我们的T恤设计车间？","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u16/u16-p123-s005.wav"},{"id":"u16-p123-s006","speaker":"narrator","text":"Here, we make beautiful and exciting T-shirts.","rects":[{"x":67.076,"y":22.09,"w":14.0856,"h":1.7375},{"x":21.0111,"y":24.2126,"w":29.3432,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ˈhɪə, wiː ˌmeɪk ˈbjuːtɪfʊl ænd ɪˈksaɪtɪŋ ˈtiːʃɜːts./","meaning":"在这里，我们做了美丽和令人兴奋的T恤。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u16/u16-p123-s006.wav"},{"id":"u16-p123-s007","speaker":"narrator","text":"It is a nice way to make your clothes suit your own special style.","rects":[{"x":50.9467,"y":24.2126,"w":35.0344,"h":1.7375},{"x":21.0111,"y":26.3353,"w":25.9729,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ˌɪt ɪz ə ˈnaɪs ˈweɪ tə ˌmeɪk jɔː ˈkləʊðz ˈsuːt jɔː ˈəʊn ˈspeʃl ˈstaɪl./","meaning":"让你的衣服适合自己特别的风格 是个好方法","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u16/u16-p123-s007.wav"},{"id":"u16-p123-s008","speaker":"narrator","text":"It is very easy to do.","rects":[{"x":21.0111,"y":29.2092,"w":19.1714,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ˌɪt ɪz ˈveriː ˈiːziː tə ˈduː./","meaning":"这样做非常容易。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u16/u16-p123-s008.wav"},{"id":"u16-p123-s010","speaker":"narrator","text":"You can draw pretty pictures on it, such as flowers, birds or people.","rects":[{"x":76.5894,"y":29.2092,"w":7.6309,"h":1.7375},{"x":21.0111,"y":31.3318,"w":56.1257,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ˌjuː kæn ˈdrɔː ˈprɪtiː ˈpɪktʃəz ˌɒn ɪt, ˈsʌtʃ æz ˈflaʊəz, ˈbɜːdz ɔː ˈpiːpəl./","meaning":"你可以在上面画漂亮的照片，如花，鸟或人。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u16/u16-p123-s010.wav"},{"id":"u16-p123-s009","speaker":"narrator","text":"We start with a white or blue T-shirt.","rects":[{"x":40.7749,"y":29.2092,"w":35.2221,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ˌwiː ˈstɑːt wɪð ə ˈwaɪt ɔː ˈbluː ˈtiːʃɜːt./","meaning":"我们从白色或蓝色T恤开始。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u16/u16-p123-s009.wav"},{"id":"u16-p123-s011","speaker":"narrator","text":"You can also write on your T-shirt.","rects":[{"x":77.7292,"y":31.3318,"w":7.6309,"h":1.7375},{"x":21.0111,"y":33.4545,"w":24.7776,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ˌjuː kæn ˈɔːlsəʊ ˈraɪt ˌɒn jɔː ˈtiːʃɜːt./","meaning":"也可以在你的T恤上写作。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u16/u16-p123-s011.wav"},{"id":"u16-p123-s012","speaker":"narrator","text":"There are paints for you to make the T-shirt colourful.","rects":[{"x":46.3811,"y":33.4545,"w":35.0324,"h":1.7375},{"x":21.0111,"y":35.5771,"w":16.1394,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ˌðeə ɑː ˈpeɪnts fɔː juː tə ˌmeɪk ðə ˈtiːʃɜːt ˈkʌləfʊl./","meaning":"有颜料让你把T恤弄得色彩鲜艳。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u16/u16-p123-s012.wav"},{"id":"u16-p123-s013","speaker":"narrator","text":"Anyone can join the workshop.","rects":[{"x":21.0111,"y":38.4511,"w":30.3736,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ˈenɪwʌn kæn ˈdʒɔɪn ðə ˈwɜːkʃɒp./","meaning":"任何人都可以加入车间。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u16/u16-p123-s013.wav"},{"id":"u16-p123-s015","speaker":"narrator","text":"So, join us at 1:30 p.m.","rects":[{"x":74.1562,"y":38.4511,"w":10.0028,"h":1.7375},{"x":21.0111,"y":40.5737,"w":11.5364,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ˌsəʊ, ˈdʒɔɪn ˌʌs æt ˈwʌn ˈθɜːtiː ˌpiːˈem/","meaning":"所以，下午1点半加入我们","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u16/u16-p123-s015.wav"},{"id":"u16-p123-s014","speaker":"narrator","text":"It is a fun DIY activity.","rects":[{"x":51.9772,"y":38.4511,"w":21.5867,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ˌɪt ɪz ə ˈfʌn ˌdiːˌaɪˈwaɪ æˈktɪvɪtiː./","meaning":"这是一个有趣的DIY活动。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u16/u16-p123-s014.wav"},{"id":"u16-p123-s016","speaker":"narrator","text":"on Saturday, at Sunshine Mall.","rects":[{"x":33.1399,"y":40.5737,"w":29.3308,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ˌɒn ˈsætədeɪ, æt ˈsʌnʃaɪn ˈmæl./","meaning":"周六，在阳光购物中心","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u16/u16-p123-s016.wav"},{"id":"u16-p123-s017","speaker":"narrator","text":"1 What can you make at the workshop?","rects":[{"x":12.0053,"y":47.3063,"w":39.1503,"h":1.7711}],"ipa":"/ˈwʌn ˌwɒt kæn juː ˌmeɪk æt ðə ˈwɜːkʃɒp?/","meaning":"1，你在车间能做什么？","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u16/u16-p123-s017.wav"},{"id":"u16-p123-s018","speaker":"narrator","text":"2 What can you draw on your T-shirt?","rects":[{"x":12.0053,"y":53.0542,"w":37.4969,"h":1.7711}],"ipa":"/ˈtuː ˌwɒt kæn juː ˈdrɔː ˌɒn jɔː ˈtiːʃɜːt?/","meaning":"2，你T恤上能画什么？","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u16/u16-p123-s018.wav"},{"id":"u16-p123-s019","speaker":"narrator","text":"3 What can you use to make the design colourful?","rects":[{"x":12.0053,"y":58.8021,"w":49.1345,"h":1.7711}],"ipa":"/ˈθriː ˌwɒt kæn juː ˈjuːz tə ˌmeɪk ðə dɪˈzaɪn ˈkʌləfʊl?/","meaning":"3，你能用什么来使设计有色彩？","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u16/u16-p123-s019.wav"},{"id":"u16-p123-s020","speaker":"narrator","text":"4 When can people join the workshop?","rects":[{"x":12.0053,"y":64.55,"w":38.7973,"h":1.7711}],"ipa":"/ˈfɔː ˌwen kæn ˈpiːpəl ˈdʒɔɪn ðə ˈwɜːkʃɒp?/","meaning":"4 何时可以参加讲习班？","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u16/u16-p123-s020.wav"},{"id":"u16-p123-s021","speaker":"narrator","text":"5 Where is the workshop?","rects":[{"x":12.0053,"y":70.2979,"w":25.8594,"h":1.7711}],"ipa":"/ˈfaɪv ˌweə ɪz ðə ˈwɜːkʃɒp?/","meaning":"5 车间在哪里？","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u16/u16-p123-s021.wav"},{"id":"u16-p123-s022","speaker":"narrator","text":"C2 What is your T-shirt design?","rects":[{"x":12.6169,"y":78.9911,"w":27.8187,"h":2.0721}],"ipa":"/ˈsiː ˈtuː ˌwɒt ɪz jɔː ˈtiːʃɜːt dɪˈzaɪn?/","meaning":"C2你的T恤设计是什么？","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u16/u16-p123-s022.wav"},{"id":"u16-p123-s023","speaker":"narrator","text":"Think about your design and write a passage about it.","rects":[{"x":40.8914,"y":78.9911,"w":47.0328,"h":2.0721}],"ipa":"/ˈθɪŋk əˈbaʊt jɔː dɪˈzaɪn ænd ˈraɪt ə ˈpæsɪdʒ əˈbaʊt ɪt./","meaning":"想想你的设计 写一段关于它。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u16/u16-p123-s023.wav"}]}]}